Let me write the service changes. First createWindow signature: `createWindow(String commandKey, String windowKey, String channelId, String startUtc, String endUtc, String plannedVolume, Integer quarter)`. Validate quarter: if != null and (quarter < 1 || quarter > 4) → 400.

Carryover logic:

```java
public CarryoverResponse carryover(String commandKey, String carryoverKey, Long sourceWindowId,
                                   Long targetWindowId, String userId, String amount) {
    requireKey("commandKey", commandKey);
    requireKey("carryoverKey", carryoverKey);
    requireKey("userId", userId);
    if (sourceWindowId == null || targetWindowId == null) throw badRequest...
    BigDecimal qty = parseAmount("amount", amount);
    if (sourceWindowId.equals(targetWindowId)) → 400? "同窗口结转无意义" — 400 INVALID_ARGUMENT. Reasonable.
    String params = "CARRYOVER|" + carryoverKey + "|" + sourceWindowId + "|" + targetWindowId + "|" + userId + "|" + qty.toPlainString();
    return runCommand("CARRYOVER", commandKey, params, CarryoverResponse.class, () -> {
        WindowRow source = repository.findWindowById(sourceWindowId);
        if (source == null) throw notFound("WINDOW_NOT_FOUND", ...);
        WindowRow target = repository.findWindowById(targetWindowId);
        if (target == null) throw notFound(...);
        // 季度校验
        if (source.quarter() == null || target.quarter() == null || !source.quarter().equals(target.quarter()))
            throw quota? → 422 QUARTER_MISMATCH
        // 目标窗口容量检查需与批准/限供串行：锁定目标窗口行
        WindowRow lockedTarget = repository.lockWindowById(targetWindowId);
        // 源申请校验
        List<AllocationRow> userAllocations = repository.listAllocations(sourceWindowId, userId);
        if (userAllocations.isEmpty()) throw notFound("SOURCE_ALLOCATION_NOT_FOUND", ...);
        List<AllocationRow> approved = userAllocations.stream().filter(APPROVED).toList();
        if (approved.isEmpty()) throw conflict("SOURCE_ALLOCATION_NOT_APPROVED", ...);
        // 余量
        BigDecimal remaining = approved.stream().map(a -> a.amount().subtract(a.consumedVolume()).subtract(a.carriedOutVolume())).reduce(ZERO, add);
        if (remaining.compareTo(qty) < 0) throw quotaExceeded(...);  // 422
        // 目标容量
        BigDecimal available = availableTotal(lockedTarget);
        BigDecimal approvedTotal = repository.sumApprovedAmount(targetWindowId);
        if (approvedTotal.add(qty).compareTo(available) > 0) throw quotaExceeded(...);  // 422
        // carryoverKey 唯一
        if (repository.findCarryoverByKey(carryoverKey) != null) throw conflict("CARRYOVER_KEY_REUSED", ...);
        // 乐观扣减
        BigDecimal need = qty;
        for (AllocationRow src : approved) {
            BigDecimal rem = src.amount().subtract(src.consumedVolume()).subtract(src.carriedOutVolume());
            if (rem.signum() <= 0) continue;
            BigDecimal draw = rem.min(need);
            if (repository.deductCarriedOut(src.id(), draw) == 0)
                throw conflict("CARRYOVER_CONFLICT", "源申请余量被并发结转占用，本次结转失败");
            need = need.subtract(draw);
            if (need.signum() == 0) break;
        }
        // 目标新建 APPROVED 申请
        long now = nowNanos();
        repository.insertApprovedAllocation(carryoverKey, targetWindowId, userId, qty, userId, now);
        repository.insertCarryover(carryoverKey, sourceWindowId, targetWindowId, userId, qty, carryoverKey, now);
        return toCarryoverResponse(repository.findCarryoverByKey(carryoverKey));
    });
}
```

Wait — issue: deductCarriedOut conditional update on the source allocation. But there's a subtle race: the remainder pre-check reads uncommitted... in READ_COMMITTED, two concurrent txs both read remainder=10, both pass the 422 check, both try deduct 10: first commits, second blocks on row lock, re-evaluates WHERE → fails → 0 rows → 409. 

But wait, there's a deadlock consideration with the target window lock: carryover locks target window row FOR UPDATE. Two carryovers A(W1→W2) and B(W2→W1): A locks W2, B locks W1. Then A does deductCarriedOut on allocation in W1 — allocation row, not window row. B deducts allocation in W2. No conflict on window rows beyond what they hold. A holds W2 lock, B holds W1 lock; A doesn't need W1 window lock, B doesn't need W2 window lock. No deadlock. But capacity check: A checks W2 approved total — reads allocations of W2 including... B will insert an APPROVED allocation into W1 (its target). A's target is W2; B's source is W2 but B doesn't change W2's approved total (carried_out doesn't affect sum of amount). So no interaction. Fine.

But hmm — do I need to lock the source window row at all? Cancel of source allocation locks source window row. Carryover doesn't lock source window → cancel and carryover can interleave: carryover reads APPROVED, cancel commits (CANCELLED), carryover's deductCarriedOut WHERE status='APPROVED' → 0 rows → 409. Good, the conditional update handles it.

What about approve of a REQUESTED allocation concurrent — irrelevant.

One more: the pre-check `remaining` uses listAllocations of user in source window — reads committed state. Fine.

Also "用水户一致" — the source allocations are queried by userId, so consistency is inherent. The target allocation is created with the same userId. ✓

Now, is 422 right for quarter mismatch? Task says 超限→422. Quarter mismatch isn't 超限. Hmm. Options: 400 or 409 or 422. The task groups "校验两窗口同季度、用水户一致、源申请当前状态为 APPROVED；任一校验失败整次回滚" without specifying codes. I'll use 422 UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY for quarter mismatch (business rule violation, semantically "cannot process"). ApiException has quotaExceeded hardcoded code QUOTA_EXCEEDED. I'll add a generic `unprocessable(code, message)` factory to ApiException. Let me add:

```java
public static ApiException unprocessable(String code, String message) {
    return new ApiException(HttpStatus.UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY, code, message);
}
```

Quarter mismatch → unprocessable("QUARTER_MISMATCH", ...). Amount over source remainder → quotaExceeded (422). Over target capacity → quotaExceeded (422). Good.

